            <figcaption>The closed housing, with the photodiode visible through the finger opening.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <h3>Finger channel details</h3>
        <p class="prose">
          I added felt inside the finger channel to give the fingertip a softer surface to rest against. These close-ups show the channel before and after fitting its cover.
        </p>
        <div class="photos">
          <figure>
            <img src="/ppg-vitals-monitor/assets/enclosure-felt-uncovered.webp" alt="Uncovered finger channel in the black printed enclosure, with felt lining the inside and the sensor visible at the bottom" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" />
